  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When someone with VRC+ creates a new instance, they have an option to set it so they are the first one to load into the world, or not. When the option is checked, then everyone else would be placed on queue before the VRC+ instance owner loads in. Once they load in, then everyone else is let in (not all simultaneously at once). Maybe in addition, the portal that was dropped will have a progress bar, or loading symbol, saying \"VRC+ Instance Owner Loading In.\" This would be a great perk for those who host events and don't want some random person within the meetup getting the instance master.",
